30	  viewed as `[for_each..., basis_dim, contracted_dim]`, statistics are formed as
31	  `G @ G.T`, and QR is run on square `basis_dim x basis_dim` matrices. Batched
32	  `512 x 512` is especially important, while `1024`, `2048`, and `4096` cover
